## Standalone-only text: names for the base kit's superweapon slots (the classic add-on keeps the original names).
standalone-sw1-name = Strategic Uplink
standalone-sw1-description = Superweapon: rapid redeployment of a group of units.
standalone-sw1-power-name = Rapid Redeployment
standalone-sw1-power-description =
    Moves a group of units across
    the map. They return after 30 seconds.
standalone-sw2-name = EW Array
standalone-sw2-description = Superweapon: an electronic shield over a group of units.
standalone-sw2-power-name = EW Shield
standalone-sw2-power-description =
    Makes a group of units immune to
    damage for 20 seconds.

## Economy pieces that replace the cut reactor and ore purifier.
standalone-hpwr-name = Heavy Power Plant
standalone-hpwr-description = Provides a large amount of power for other structures.
standalone-purifier-name = Refinery Purifier
standalone-purifier-description =
    Refinery upgrade: place it on a refinery.
    That refinery earns 25% more from ore.

